{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":39639420,"ns":0,"title":"Offshore geotechnical engineering","extract":"Offshore geotechnical engineering is a sub-field of geotechnical engineering. It is concerned with foundation design, construction, maintenance and decommissioning for human-made structures in the sea.","description":"Sub-field of engineering concerned with human-made structures in the sea","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}